{"seq":3,"slug":"pre-deduction-stockup","title":"预扣库存与活动备货","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/inventory-reservation-fulfillment/concurrency-cache/pre-deduction-stockup","wordCount":2377,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"预扣库存与活动备货\">预扣库存与活动备货</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>前面三章讨论的都是「已经存在的库存如何被竞争」。本章讨论库存的来源：大促的额度不是凭空出现的，它来自日常库存的划拨、在途货物的提前计入、以及供应商的临时备货。这三个来源有一个共同特征——<strong>它们都是时间维度上的分配问题，而不是并发问题</strong>。这里没有抢，只有「什么时候把多少货划到哪个池子、什么时候再划回来」。</p>\n<p>预扣（pre-deduction / 预占额度）指的是在活动开始前，运营或系统先把一部分库存从常规可售池转移到活动池，使活动池的额度在活动期间可以被独立扣减。它的商业动机有三个：</p>\n<p><strong>动机一：隔离。</strong> 活动价通常低于日常价，如果不隔离，活动额度会被日常流量的黄牛或套利用户蚕食。隔离让活动真正服务的对象拿到货。</p>\n<p><strong>动机二：可承诺。</strong> 市场部需要一个确定的数字去投放广告：「这个活动有 10 万台」。这个承诺必须在活动开始前锁定，不能在活动开始后从日常库存里现借。</p>\n<p><strong>动机三：风险控制。</strong> 活动库存的履约压力（打包、发货、客服）需要提前与仓储沟通产能。额度一旦划出，履约侧才能做资源准备。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    POOL[&quot;常规可售池&lt;br/&gt;available = 30000&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;活动前 3 天&lt;br/&gt;划拨 10000&quot;| ACT[&quot;活动池&lt;br/&gt;quota = 10000&quot;]&#10;    ACT --&gt;|&quot;活动开始&quot;| LIVE[&quot;活动进行中&lt;br/&gt;独立扣减&quot;]&#10;    LIVE --&gt;|&quot;售罄&quot;| SOLD[&quot;活动页置灰&quot;]&#10;    LIVE --&gt;|&quot;活动结束未售完&quot;| RB[&quot;回收余量&lt;br/&gt;ACT 余量 → 常规池&quot;]&#10;    POOL --&gt;|&quot;在途货物提前计入&quot;| INB[&quot;预计入库&lt;br/&gt;in_transit&quot;]&#10;    INB --&gt;|&quot;实际到仓&quot;| POOL&#10;    SUP[&quot;供应商临时备货&lt;br/&gt;承诺供货&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;到仓后&quot;| POOL&#10;    RB --&gt; POOL\">graph TD\n    POOL[\"常规可售池&lt;br/&gt;available = 30000\"] --&gt;|\"活动前 3 天&lt;br/&gt;划拨 10000\"| ACT[\"活动池&lt;br/&gt;quota = 10000\"]\n    ACT --&gt;|\"活动开始\"| LIVE[\"活动进行中&lt;br/&gt;独立扣减\"]\n    LIVE --&gt;|\"售罄\"| SOLD[\"活动页置灰\"]\n    LIVE --&gt;|\"活动结束未售完\"| RB[\"回收余量&lt;br/&gt;ACT 余量 → 常规池\"]\n    POOL --&gt;|\"在途货物提前计入\"| INB[\"预计入库&lt;br/&gt;in_transit\"]\n    INB --&gt;|\"实际到仓\"| POOL\n    SUP[\"供应商临时备货&lt;br/&gt;承诺供货\"] --&gt;|\"到仓后\"| POOL\n    RB --&gt; POOL</pre><p>注意图中「在途货物提前计入」这条边：它把 <code>in_transit</code> 暂时算进了常规可售池。这是一个<strong>有风险的操作</strong>，如果货物没有按期到仓，就会产生有单无货。它的使用条件是供应商的历史按时到货率足够高，且偏差有兜底（见下文的超卖容错）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"划拨与回收-原子性要求\">划拨与回收：原子性要求</h2><p>划拨看起来只是两个数字的加减，但它是本章最容易出错的地方，因为它跨两个记录（常规池与活动池），且必须原子。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 错误：两条独立语句，中间崩溃会导致额度凭空多出或消失&#10;UPDATE inventory SET available = available - 10000 WHERE sku_id = ? AND warehouse_id = ?;&#10;UPDATE activity_quota SET quota = quota + 10000 WHERE activity_id = ? AND sku_id = ?;&#10;&#10;-- 正确：单条事务内的条件更新 + 影响行数检查&#10;START TRANSACTION;&#10;UPDATE inventory SET available = available - 10000&#10;WHERE sku_id = ? AND warehouse_id = ? AND available &gt;= 10000;&#10;-- 检查影响行数 = 1，否则 ROLLBACK&#10;UPDATE activity_quota SET quota = quota + 10000&#10;WHERE activity_id = ? AND sku_id = ? AND warehouse_id = ?;&#10;COMMIT;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 错误：两条独立语句，中间崩溃会导致额度凭空多出或消失</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inventory </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> available </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> available </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10000</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ? </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> warehouse_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> activity_quota </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10000</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> activity_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ? </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 正确：单条事务内的条件更新 + 影响行数检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">START TRANSACTION</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inventory </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> available </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> available </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ? </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> warehouse_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ? </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> available </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 检查影响行数 = 1，否则 ROLLBACK</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> activity_quota </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> activity_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ? </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ? </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> warehouse_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">COMMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>available &gt;= 10000</code> 这个谓词是防止「划拨超过实际库存」的唯一保护。运营在后台填写划拨数量时，必须由系统检查而不是靠人眼核对。</p>\n<p>回收方向相反且<strong>不能无条件执行</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"START TRANSACTION;&#10;UPDATE activity_quota SET quota = quota - ? , status = &#39;CLOSED&#39;&#10;WHERE activity_id = ? AND sku_id = ? AND warehouse_id = ? AND quota &gt;= ?;&#10;-- 影响行数 = 1 才继续&#10;UPDATE inventory SET available = available + ?&#10;WHERE sku_id = ? AND warehouse_id = ?;&#10;COMMIT;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">START TRANSACTION</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> activity_quota </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ? , </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CLOSED'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> activity_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ? </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ? </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> warehouse_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ? </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 影响行数 = 1 才继续</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inventory </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> available </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> available </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ? </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> warehouse_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">COMMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>回收的判定必须是「活动池的实际余量」，而不是「原始划拨量」。活动期间已经卖掉的货不能回收——如果回收逻辑写成了「把原始划拨的 10000 全部还回常规池」，就会凭空造出已售出的额度，直接超卖。这是一个非常典型的 bug：开发时测试环境活动没有成交量，回收看起来正确；上线后大促当天回收执行一次，库存瞬间虚增一万。</p>\n<h2 id=\"在途库存与预计入库的计入\">在途库存与预计入库的计入</h2><p>在途库存（<code>in_transit</code>）是「已下单采购、供应商已发货、但尚未到仓」的货物。把它计入可售是有实际业务价值的——大促前一周的采购在途量往往是常规库存的数倍，不计入就等于放弃了这部分销售能力。但它的计入必须满足三个条件：</p>\n<p><strong>条件一：可取消性。</strong> 如果订单能被用户取消，而对应在途货未到，就会产生有单无货。所以要按「预计到货日 ≤ 承诺发货日 + 容差」筛选，只把高置信度的在途计入。</p>\n<p><strong>条件二：独立字段。</strong> <code>in_transit</code> 必须是独立字段，不能并进 <code>on_hand</code>。理由见 <a href=\"../inventory-model/inventory-quantities\">物理/可售/预占/冻结库存关系</a>：一旦并入，盘点时无法区分「账面比实物多」是因为在途还是因为错账。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mtext>可承诺</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>高置信</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">available_{可承诺} = on\\_hand + in\\_transit_{高置信} - reserved - frozen - safety\\_stock</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ab</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">可承诺</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">han</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9695em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">in</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">高置信</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">eser</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">oz</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">oc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>条件三：到仓后必须冲销。</strong> 在途货到仓时，WMS 会让 <code>on_hand</code> 增加，此时如果不把 <code>in_transit</code> 减掉，同一批货会被计入两次。这个冲销动作必须与 WMS 的入库确认绑定，且是幂等的（见 <a href=\"../fulfillment-sync/wms-sync\">与仓储系统的库存同步/补偿</a>）。</p>\n<p>在途库存的置信度可以用历史数据估算：设某供应商过去 N 次采购的平均到货延迟与标准差，则「预计到货日 + 2 倍标准差」内的到货概率约为 95.5%（正态分布下 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>σ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mn>95.45</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\mu-2\\sigma \\le X \\le \\mu+2\\sigma) \\approx 95.45\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7804em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">95.45%</span></span></span></span></span>，来源：Wikipedia — 68–95–99.7 rule, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/68%E2%80%9395%E2%80%9399.7_rule；若取单侧上界则为约\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/68%E2%80%9395%E2%80%9399.7_rule；若取单侧上界则为约</a> 97.7%）。用这个概率乘以在途量得到期望可承诺量，比拍一个折扣系数更可解释。相关统计学基础与安全库存的推导同源，见 <a href=\"../fulfillment-sync/replenishment-alert\">补货阈值、安全库存与告警</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>在途状态</th>\n<th>是否计入可售</th>\n<th>计入比例</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>供应商已发货、正常在途</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>高置信部分全额</td>\n<td>到货延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已下单未发货</td>\n<td>谨慎</td>\n<td>0 或低比例</td>\n<td>供应商违约</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>报关中/清关中</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>按历史清关时长折扣</td>\n<td>清关延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>到仓待质检</td>\n<td>否（counted in on_hand，frozen）</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>质检不合格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异常在途（超期未到）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>需人工核实</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"活动备货的预算模型\">活动备货的预算模型</h2><p>活动备货的核心决策是「备多少」。备少了缺货损失销售与广告投放效果，备多了活动结束后变成滞销库存占用资金。这是一个可以用期望值计算的问题。</p>\n<p>设活动需求量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 为一个随机变量，备货量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>，单位售价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，单位成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，活动后残值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s &lt; c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>）。缺货的单位机会损失为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p - c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>（少赚的毛利），滞销的单位损失为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c - s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>（残值折价）。经典报童模型（newsvendor model）给出最优备货量的临界分位数（临界分位数 = 缺货成本 / (缺货成本 + 过季成本)，来源：Wikipedia — Newsvendor model, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Newsvendor_model）：\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Newsvendor_model）：</a></p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F(Q^*) = \\frac{p - c}{(p - c) + (c - s)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 是需求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 的累积分布函数。这个式子的直觉是：备货到「缺货的边际损失等于滞销的边际损失」的那一点。若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>199</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = 199</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">199</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c = 80</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s = 30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>119</mn><mrow><mn>119</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0.704</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F(Q^*) = \\frac{119}{119 + 50} = 0.704</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0908em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">119</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">119</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.704</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即备货量应取历史需求分布的 70.4 分位数。若历史活动需求近似正态分布，均值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu = 8000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8000</span></span></span></span></span>、标准差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma = 2000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2000</span></span></span></span></span>，则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>0.704</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>8000</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.537</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2000</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>9074</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q^* = \\mu + z_{0.704} \\cdot \\sigma \\approx 8000 + 0.537 \\times 2000 = 9074</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9331em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.704</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.537</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9074</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个结果比「按经验均值备 8000」多出约 13%，而它多出的这部分恰好是抵住右侧需求尾巴的缓冲。报童模型的价值不在于精度（需求分布本身就有误差），而在于它迫使团队把「缺货损失」与「滞销损失」写下来，而不是靠感觉加一个百分比。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    H[&quot;历史活动需求数据&quot;] --&gt; F[&quot;拟合分布&lt;br/&gt;均值 μ + 标准差 σ&quot;]&#10;    P[&quot;定价 p / 成本 c / 残值 s&quot;] --&gt; CR[&quot;临界分位数&lt;br/&gt;F(Q*) = (p-c)/((p-c)+(c-s))&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; Q[&quot;备货量 Q*&quot;]&#10;    CR --&gt; Q&#10;    Q --&gt; RV[&quot;复盘:实际需求 vs Q*&lt;br/&gt;更新 μ/σ 与残值估计&quot;]&#10;    RV --&gt; F\">graph LR\n    H[\"历史活动需求数据\"] --&gt; F[\"拟合分布&lt;br/&gt;均值 μ + 标准差 σ\"]\n    P[\"定价 p / 成本 c / 残值 s\"] --&gt; CR[\"临界分位数&lt;br/&gt;F(Q*) = (p-c)/((p-c)+(c-s))\"]\n    F --&gt; Q[\"备货量 Q*\"]\n    CR --&gt; Q\n    Q --&gt; RV[\"复盘:实际需求 vs Q*&lt;br/&gt;更新 μ/σ 与残值估计\"]\n    RV --&gt; F</pre><h2 id=\"备货与预占的衔接\">备货与预占的衔接</h2><p>活动池的额度就绪后，活动期间的扣减走的是前三章的机制，只是作用在活动池上。这带来一个必须处理的边界：<strong>活动池与常规池的边界在活动开始时是刚性的，在余额不足时可以被打破吗？</strong></p>\n<p>三种策略：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>严格隔离。</strong> 活动池售罄即活动结束，即使常规池有大量库存。适用于法律或合同要求明确额度的场景（如「限量 1000 台」）。</li>\n<li><strong>溢出共享。</strong> 活动池售罄后可继续从常规池扣减。适用于促销活动的真实意图是「促进销量」而非「限量」。</li>\n<li><strong>动态补充。</strong> 系统按实时转化率与剩下的活动时间动态从常规池补额度给活动池。这是最复杂但在大促日常混合流量下最有效的策略，它需要活动池的扣减路径支持「额度补充」事件，且补充本身要幂等。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>无论选哪种，<strong>必须有一个开关</strong>，且开关的默认值是「严格隔离」（保守）。理由是「溢出共享」配置错误会消耗掉不该动的日常库存，而这在大促当天是无法挽回的。</p>\n<p>活动结束后的收尾有三件事，缺一不可：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>关闭活动池</strong>，拒绝新的扣减。</li>\n<li><strong>回收余量</strong>到常规池（用上面的事务写法，且只回收实际余量）。</li>\n<li><strong>对账</strong>活动期间的扣减总量与活动池的消耗量是否相等，任何差异都要在活动报告里说明（见 <a href=\"cache-db-consistency\">Redis 缓存与 DB 库存对账</a>）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>预扣与备货是时间维度上的分配问题，与并发竞争是两类问题；它们的错误模式是「划拨不原子」「回收用原始量而非余量」。</li>\n<li>划拨与回收必须在单事务内用条件更新完成，并检查影响行数；回收只能回收实际余量，用原始划拨量回收会凭空造出已售出的额度。</li>\n<li>在途库存可计入可售，但必须是独立字段、按置信度折扣、且到仓后幂等冲销；并入 <code>on_hand</code> 会让盘点无法解释差异。</li>\n<li>备货量可以用报童模型算出临界分位数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F(Q^*) = (p-c)/((p-c)+(c-s))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">((</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span>，它的价值在于迫使团队量化缺货与滞销两类损失，而不是给出精确数字。</li>\n<li>活动池与常规池的边界策略（严格隔离/溢出共享/动态补充）必须有开关，且默认取保守值。</li>\n<li>活动收尾必须包含关闭、回收、对账三件事；对账差异要在活动报告中显式说明。</li>\n<li>下一步：额度划出之后，订单如何选择从哪个仓发货，见 <a href=\"../fulfillment-sync/warehouse-allocation\">多仓分货与履约路由</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"预扣库存与活动备货","id":"预扣库存与活动备货"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"划拨与回收：原子性要求","id":"划拨与回收-原子性要求"},{"level":2,"text":"在途库存与预计入库的计入","id":"在途库存与预计入库的计入"},{"level":2,"text":"活动备货的预算模型","id":"活动备货的预算模型"},{"level":2,"text":"备货与预占的衔接","id":"备货与预占的衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Redis 缓存与 DB 库存对账","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/inventory-reservation-fulfillment/concurrency-cache/cache-db-consistency"},"next":{"title":"多仓分货与履约路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/inventory-reservation-fulfillment/fulfillment-sync/warehouse-allocation"}}